{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38946","headline":"下第东归将及故园有作 · 杜荀鹤","name":"下第东归将及故园有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生操立有天知，何事谋身与志违。\n上国献诗还不遇，故园经乱又空归。\n山城欲暮人烟歛，江月初寒钓艇归。\n且把风寒作闲事，懒能和泪拜庭闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}